    "actClause": "AN ACT to amend chapter 122 of the laws of 2000 amending the environmental\nconservation law relating to authorizing sweepstakes with respect to\nsubscriptions to \"The Conservationist\", in relation to the effectiveness\nthereof",
    "basePrintNo": "S9321",
    "basePrintNoStr": "S9321-2023",
    "coSponsors": {
